<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't you see?]</font>

162
00:11:48,395 --> 00:11:52,607
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You've given power to me too...
and I want you to know that.</font>

163
00:11:53,567 --> 00:11:56,653
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm doing for him... what he does for me?</font>

164
00:11:57,696 --> 00:12:00,198
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I never could've imagined that.</font>

165
00:12:01,074 --> 00:12:06,455
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But... if that really is the case...
that would make me so incredibly happy.</font>

166
00:12:16,715 --> 00:12:18,425
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nice going, Sadako!</font>

167
00:12:18,508 --> 00:12:22,304
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- With the Hirano and Endo thing.
- I heard that they both helped you out.</font>

168
00:12:22,387 --> 00:12:26,308
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They did~ and it's all
thanks to the two of you!</font>

169
00:12:26,391 --> 00:12:30,562
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Since you've been talking to me. Because
of that... I think... Hirano and Endo felt a</font>

170
00:12:30,645 --> 00:12:34,858
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">lot more comfortable talking to me too.</font>

171
00:12:35,567 --> 00:12:37,235
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, thank you.</font>

172
00:12:37,319 --> 00:12:38,445
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You idiot!</font>

173
00:12:41,698 --> 00:12:44,910
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Translation: she wants you to know it's
because you did your best. She's right</font>

174
00:12:44,993 --> 00:12:48,246
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">about that, Sadako.</font>

175
00:12:48,789 --> 00:12:53,585
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- That win's completely yours.
- I have no words... I still can't believe</font>

176
00:12:53,668 --> 00:12:57,964
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">how truly blessed I am to be able to talk
to such kind people...</font>

177
00:12:58,048 --> 00:13:02,385
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh yeah, by the way... what's that book?
- Uh, this? Ghost stories.</font>

178
00:13:03,345 --> 00:13:05,806
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Ghost stories?!
- I figured if I had this, I might be</font>

179
00:13:05,889 --> 00:13:08,350
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">able to live up to everyone's
expectations.</font>

180
00:13:08,433 --> 00:13:11,144
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako's story time?</font>

181
00:13:11,228 --> 00:13:12,938
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Actually, I'm interested!</font>

182
00:13:13,021 --> 00:13:14,940
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're so dang positiiiiiive!</font>

183
00:13:15,941 --> 00:13:20,362
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess it's either that or her
brain's just wired differently.</font>

184
00:13:20,946 --> 00:13:25,242
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh, ~ so your midterms
will be covered up to here.</font>

185
00:13:25,325 --> 00:13:27,327
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- This is bad!
- Seriously?!</font>

186
00:13:50,058 --> 00:13:51,309
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wha...</font>

187
00:13:51,393 --> 00:13:55,480
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- And what are you doing, Kazehaya?!
- I was... Killing a bug?!</font>

188
00:13:56,314 --> 00:14:01,653
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was meant for Yano! I finally got my
very first mission and I butchered it...</font>

189
00:14:02,404 --> 00:14:05,490
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">TO KURONUMA, I MEANT</font>

190
00:14:16,418 --> 00:14:17,627
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ku-ro-nu-ma.</font>

191
00:14:25,886 --> 00:14:27,888
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">ONCE I GET HOME,
I'LL WALK MARU,</font>

192
00:14:27,971 --> 00:14:29,973
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">SO IF YOU'RE FREE,
COME SEE MARU.</font>

193
00:14:30,056 --> 00:14:32,017
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">RIVERBED WE PICKED HIM UP.
KAZE</font>

194
00:14:44,738 --> 00:14:45,780
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'LL GO.</font>

195
00:14:50,869 --> 00:14:53,371
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My handwriting... got so shaky.</font>

196
00:14:58,627 --> 00:15:01,004
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Once I drop these handouts off at the
faculty office, I'll go home, change</font>

197
00:15:01,087 --> 00:15:03,465
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">clothes and...</font>

198
00:15:06,343 --> 00:15:08,386
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm getting too carried away.</font>

199
00:15:09,763 --> 00:15:12,349
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've gotta pull myself together.</font>

200
00:15:20,565 --> 00:15:21,483
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Here.</font>

201
00:15:22,943 --> 00:15:24,194
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh! Uh. Thanks.</font>

202
00:15:24,945 --> 00:15:25,946
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No prob.</font>

203
00:15:29,950 --> 00:15:33,036
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}She looks like a French bisque doll. This
must be the luckiest time of my life right</font>

204
00:15:33,119 --> 00:15:36,206
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">now!</font>

205
00:15:42,837 --> 00:15:44,297
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait! Maru!</font>

206
00:15:44,381 --> 00:15:45,924
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Aww It's really him!</font>

207
00:15:49,386 --> 00:15:50,512
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Come here!</font>

208
00:15:53,515 --> 00:15:54,432
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maru!</font>

209
00:15:56,142 --> 00:15:58,186
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait~ that's what you wanted?</font>

210
00:16:00,814 --> 00:16:02,857
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Yes! My treats tactic worked!</font>

211
00:16:05,735 --> 00:16:06,945
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey! He likes it!</font>

212
00:16:08,488 --> 00:16:10,365
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And now he's talking to me!</font>

213
00:16:12,367 --> 00:16:14,452
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What kinda things do
you usually do, Kuronuma?</font>

214
00:16:14,536 --> 00:16:16,663
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh... I study mostly.</font>

215
00:16:18,206 --> 00:16:20,083
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't mean before
tests. In your free time.</font>

216
00:16:20,166 --> 00:16:22,043
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I study... mostly?</font>

217
00:16:23,169 --> 00:16:26,798
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Woah! And here I am, flying out the
door and barely making it in time!</font>

218
00:16:26,881 --> 00:16:30,468
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um, I guess there's something else?</font>

219
00:16:30,552 --> 00:16:33,388
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sometimes I imagine
things, and that's fun--</font>

220
00:16:33,471 --> 00:16:36,558
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, what do you mean by "imagine things"?</font>

221
00:16:36,641 --> 00:16:40,103
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I make these scenarios. For example~ I
imagine the person sitting next to me in</font>

222
00:16:40,186 --> 00:16:43,606
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">class has a problem
they don't understand.</font>

223
00:16:43,690 --> 00:16:46,568
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I ask them what part they got stuck on.</font>

224
00:16:46,651 --> 00:16:51,448
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And then I try to think of how I can
explain it in the simplest way. Before I</font>

225
00:16:51,531 --> 00:16:56,369
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">knew it, studying like that
unintentionally became a habit for me.</font>

226
00:16:58,872 --> 00:17:01,875
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">By the way, I'm just curious,
did you tell anyone about Maru?</font>

227
00:17:01,958 --> 00:17:04,961
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mm-mm. gotcha.</font>

228
00:17:07,756 --> 00:17:10,800
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">In other words. Only the two of us know
about you finding him and me adopting him,</font>

229
00:17:10,884 --> 00:17:13,970
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">huh?</font>

230
00:17:15,305 --> 00:17:18,308
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Right, then I'm not
gonna tell anyone else.</font>

231
00:17:22,395 --> 00:17:24,064
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That smile...</font>

232
00:17:24,147 --> 00:17:28,610
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All of his smiles... Even though so many
other people get to see them, for this</font>

233
00:17:28,693 --> 00:17:33,156
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">moment at least... I get them all to myself.
They give me hope that tomorrow... will be</font>

234
00:17:33,239 --> 00:17:37,660
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">another wonderful day.</font>

235
00:17:41,081 --> 00:17:42,123
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kuronuma.</font>

236
00:17:42,707 --> 00:17:44,584
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Can you teach me this part?</font>

237
00:17:45,210 --> 00:17:47,670
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm the person sitting next to you.</font>

238
00:17:49,005 --> 00:17:51,841
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They used "what" here, but I don't
really understand. Could you explain it?</font>

239
00:17:51,925 --> 00:17:54,761
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hm?
- Oh, in this context, the "what"</font>

240
00:17:54,844 --> 00:17:57,639
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- is called a relative pronoun and...
- Hm?</font>

241
00:17:57,722 --> 00:18:00,517
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait~ are you guys
actually studying over here?</font>

242
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:03,520
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, that means it connects the dependent
clause here with an independent clause.</font>

243
00:18:03,603 --> 00:18:05,313
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This one... to this.</font>

244
00:18:05,396 --> 00:18:08,024
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh! I see! Makes sense.
- Ah...</font>

245
00:18:08,108 --> 00:18:09,984
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What?
- Are they all getting tutored by Sadako?</font>

246
00:18:10,068 --> 00:18:12,278
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hang on, I think I get it!</font>

247
00:18:12,362 --> 00:18:14,614
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So then, if you were to
connect this one here with this one...</font>

248
00:18:14,697 --> 00:18:17,283
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I did it! I figured it out this time!</font>

249
00:18:17,367 --> 00:18:19,994
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I- I can't believe she
helped Yoshida solve a problem.</font>

250
00:18:20,078 --> 00:18:22,622
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know, you're really
good at teaching. For real.</font>

251
00:18:22,705 --> 00:18:25,291
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What?</font>

252
00:18:26,167 --> 00:18:30,713
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Would you mind if we joined you guys?
- Please teach us, we're so lost.</font>

253
00:18:30,797 --> 00:18:33,716
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- That's why... this is the same formula...
- Oh, yeah, you're right!</font>

254
00:18:33,800 --> 00:18:36,761
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I couldn't get it no
matter how many times I tried.</font>

255
00:18:36,845 --> 00:18:38,972
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Me too!
- Here, if you do this...</font>

256
00:18:39,055 --> 00:18:41,182
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Even I could understand!
- Wow, you make it so easy!</font>

257
00:18:41,266 --> 00:18:43,643
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You should get up front
and use the chalkboard.]</font>

258
00:18:43,726 --> 00:18:46,312
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you, Sadako!</font>

259
00:18:46,396 --> 00:18:48,982
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Please tutor us again, Miss Kuronuma!
- Thank you!</font>

260
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:54,237
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I helped! I finally did
something that really helped!</font>

261
00:18:56,322 --> 00:19:00,952
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You sure do move to the
beat of your own drum, Sadako.</font>

262
00:19:17,135 --> 00:19:18,428
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She...</font>

263
00:19:18,511 --> 00:19:19,429
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She- she smi-</font>

264
00:19:20,054 --> 00:19:21,431
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait, what?</font>

265
00:19:21,514 --> 00:19:23,766
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Woah did you guys just see that?</font>

266
00:19:30,398 --> 00:19:31,608
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">K-Kazehaya.</font>

267
00:19:35,570 --> 00:19:39,532
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Well uh, today I--
- I'm happy for you! ' Just like our talk.</font>

268
00:19:39,616 --> 00:19:42,994
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Everyone came over like
you've always wanted.</font>

269
00:19:43,077 --> 00:19:45,580
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Of course that made me really happy.</font>

270
00:19:46,122 --> 00:19:50,210
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But my scenario from yesterday had
already become a reality the moment that</font>

271
00:19:50,293 --> 00:19:54,380
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you asked me to teach you. So, I know
you might be tired of hearing this, but I</font>

272
00:19:54,464 --> 00:19:58,635
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">still wanted to say...</font>

273
00:19:58,718 --> 00:19:59,636
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you.</font>

274
00:20:03,431 --> 00:20:04,849
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, Kazehaya!</font>

275
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:10,271
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh, ' is he talking with someone?
- Let's head out.</font>

276
00:20:10,355 --> 00:20:13,316
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sorry, I'm a real selfish guy.</font>

277
00:20:14,442 --> 00:20:18,571
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I thought I was the only one
who knew ~ about ~ that smile.</font>

278
00:20:21,366 --> 00:20:24,577
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, let me just have this one to myself.</font>

279
00:20:25,703 --> 00:20:27,121
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This one's all mine.</font>

280
00:20:28,623 --> 00:20:33,169
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Man, that is the first time
I've seen Sadako smile like that!</font>

281
00:20:33,253 --> 00:20:36,506
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When you see her make a face like that,
she actually seems pretty normal, huh?</font>

282
00:20:36,589 --> 00:20:39,842
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What? Really? ~ Yoshida... she's that
one girl with the narrow eyes, right?</font>

283
00:20:39,926 --> 00:20:43,012
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh-huh! I heard she was a
delinquent and even went to juvie before.</font>

284
00:20:43,096 --> 00:20:46,224
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah! And the Yano girl too.
Apparently she's a total nympho!</font>

285
00:20:46,307 --> 00:20:49,269
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Someone said she went through a
hundred guys just in middle school!</font>

286
00:20:49,352 --> 00:20:52,313
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No way, girl, that's insane!</font>

287
00:20:52,397 --> 00:20:54,482
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hmmm? Oh, really now?</font>

288
00:20:54,565 --> 00:20:56,859
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- And? Who exactly said that?
- Oh, uh...</font>

289
00:20:58,903 --> 00:21:01,406
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Who, C'mon, spill it.</font>

290
00:21:01,489 --> 00:21:03,408
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">E-Everyone's been say--</font>

291
00:21:03,491 --> 00:21:08,037
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't give me that. I'm asking
you where this bullcrap started!</font>

292
00:21:08,579 --> 00:21:11,666
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What's the source?
- Sa... Sadako</font>

293
00:22:27,241 --> 00:22:28,993
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Misunderstood words.</font>

294
00:22:29,744 --> 00:22:32,330
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Feelings that won't reach.</font>

295
00:22:32,413 --> 00:22:34,248
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: ~ "Rumors"</font>
